<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				 3-mths	  6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	 11.55 /11.45  11.85 /11.70   12.25 /12.15</p>
<p>BPI			 11.75 /11.45  11.95 /11.70   12.30 /12.10</p>
<p>Citibank		  11.50 /11.40  11.75 /11.65   12.20 /12.10</p>
<p>FarEast		   11.55 /11.45  11.85 /11.75   12.30 /12.20</p>
<p>Metrobank		 11.60 /11.40  11.80  /11.65  12.25 /12.10</p>
<p>PNB			 11.55 /11.45  11.825 /11.70  12.10 /12.00</p>
<p>PCIBank		   11.75 /11.50  12.00  /11.70  12.35 /12.10</p>
<p>Solidbank		 11.55 /11.475 11.80  /11.725 12.20/12.125</p>
<p>StandChart		11.60 /11.45  11.775 /11.675 12.175/12.05</p>
